  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: Elevex is a premium, science-backed wellness brand focused on gut health as the foundation of performance, energy, and long-term health. Our flagship product, Elevex Gut Powder, is formulated with clinically researched ingredients including bovine colostrum (30% IgG), PHGG prebiotic fiber, tributyrin butyrate, and targeted micronutrients. We prioritize quality, transparency, and real-world results over hype or gimmicks.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different: We focus on clinically dosed ingredients, clean formulations, and education-driven marketing. Elevex is built for people who care about performance, digestion, and sustainable health—not quick fixes.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: Affiliates earn competitive commissions on every qualifying sale, with opportunities to increase rates based on performance. Payments are tracked reliably through links and/or unique discount codes.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us: Affiliates may promote Elevex through authentic content such as social media, blogs, videos, newsletters, and direct sharing with their audience. Paid ads, coupon sites, and brand bidding are not permitted.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information: We review affiliates manually to ensure strong brand alignment and long-term partnerships.</p></div></div>",
